## Environment Variables

> [!IMPORTANT]
> A GitHub Personal Access Token is needed for the GitHub API. Do you want to:
> - **Option A**: Add a `GITHUB_TOKEN` to your backend `.env` (server-side, single token for all students)
> - **Option B**: Have each student provide their own GitHub token during onboarding (more complex)
>
> **Recommended: Option A** — simpler, and the public repos API has generous rate limits with a token.

